  ("p", "You do not need to post daily. But a profile with zero activity looks abandoned, and a profile with a handful of substantive posts about what you built reads as evidence. Posting the thing you made, with a link and what you learned, is the highest-value-per-minute activity on the platform — and it is the same content as your portfolio, so it costs you nothing new."),
